# Bottom Bar Skia — 3-tab gooey Skia tab bar; a purple circle springs to the tapped tab
# and the metaball notch follows (Blur + ColorMatrix layer), icons spring up/recolor.
# What this test covers: each tab via the Skia-gesture Touchable.Rect hit areas
# (x 67/201/335, y 830), first<->last long jumps, mid-flight retargeting of the
# spring with fast alternating taps, rapid repeated taps on one tab, re-tap of
# the active tab.
context platform=ios
open "demos://animations/bottom-bar-skia"
wait "label=\"Close\"" 10000
wait 1000
press 201 830
wait 900
press 335 830
wait 900
press 201 830
wait 900
press 67 830
wait 900
# Long jumps across the whole bar.
press 335 830
wait 1000
press 67 830
wait 1000
# Retarget the circle mid-spring.
press 335 830
wait 100
press 67 830
wait 100
press 201 830
wait 100
press 335 830
wait 1200
# Rapid taps on one tab and re-tapping the active tab.
press 67 830 --count 5
wait 1000
press 67 830
wait 800
wait "label=\"Close\"" 3000
press "role=\"button\" label=\"Close\" id=\"xmark\""
wait 1500
